  first | exact @_root_.GlobalTheory.CosCount.card_kCosets_theta | exact _root_.GlobalTheory.CosCount.card_kCosets_theta | (intros; apply _root_.GlobalTheory.CosCount.card_kCosets_theta <;> assumption)
